sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Manager
  participant A as API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant J as Sync job (pg-boss)
  participant G as Microsoft Graph
  participant X as Excel on SharePoint
  participant F as Existing Flows 2 & 3
  M->>A: Submit EOD (logged in)
  A->>A: Recalculate totals server-side
  A->>D: Save trading_day (status = submitted)
  A->>D: Enqueue outbound_sync_job (payload hash)
  J->>D: Pick job
  J->>G: Add/update row in EOD table (same columns as today)
  G->>X: Write row
  X-->>F: Targets lookup & emails keep working (Stage 1)
  alt Graph error
    J->>D: attempts+1, retry with backoff
    J-->>M: Alert finance if still failing after retries
  end
  J->>G: Read targets sheet nightly → site_targets
